        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Average daily consumption is calculated based on the data over a period: %1
Average daily consumption is adjusted according to the &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Seasonal effects.Team.Seasonal Effects>seasonal indexes&lt;/> of the seasonal group.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>میانگین مصرف روزانه بر اساس داده‌های دوره زیر محاسبه می‌شود: %1
میانگین مصرف روزانه طبق &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Seasonal effects.Team.Seasonal Effects>شاخص‌های فصلی&lt;/> گروه فصلی تعدیل می‌شود.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Среднедневное потребление расчитывается по данным за период: %1
Среднедневное потребление корректируется согласно &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Seasonal effects.Team.Seasonal Effects>сезонным коэффициентам&lt;/> соответствущей сезонной группы.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Ortalama günlük tüketim, dönem verilerine göre hesaplanmıştır: %1
 Ortalama günlük tüketim&lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Seasonal effects.Team.Seasonal Effects>ilgili dönemsel grubunun &lt;/>dönemsel oranlarına göre ayarlanır.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Tiêu thụ trung bình hàng ngày được tính trên cơ sở dữ liệu trong giai đoạn: %1 
Mức tiêu thụ trung bình hàng ngày được điều chỉnh theo &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Seasonal effects.Team.Seasonal Effects>các yếu tố mùa vụ&lt;/> của nhóm theo mùa tương ứng.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Average daily consumption is calculated based on the data over a period: %1
Average daily consumption is adjusted according to the &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Seasonal effects.Team.Seasonal Effects>seasonal indexes&lt;/> of the seasonal group.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Average daily consumption is calculated based on the data over a period: %1
